This license covers the source code in this repository only.

The trained model weights are distributed separately, under
CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, at https://huggingface.co/itayinbar/Mishkefet-v1

The weights changed licence on 2026-09-15 and this is deliberate rather than an
oversight. Earlier releases were CC-BY-4.0. The current model is trained on
BiblIA (https://zenodo.org/records/5167263), which is CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, and those
terms propagate: NonCommercial means the weights may not be used commercially,
and ShareAlike means derivatives carry the same licence.

Anyone who needs permissive terms should train with `--real-hebrew pinkas`,
which uses only the CC-BY-4.0 corpus. That costs 9,276 of the 10,219 real Hebrew
lines and will score worse.

The datasets used for training and evaluation carry their own licenses, listed
in README.md. In particular the ivrit.ai benchmark is gated under the ivrit.ai
License, and the original IAM-DB and KHATT corpora carry terms of their own that
their Hugging Face mirrors do not restate.
